      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0003>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00030000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "謝謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳跑了這趟過來。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B1D8B1D00100003110000FF01014F6059B38DD14E8690198D9F904E4F86300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "話說，<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳知道我為什麼要找<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8A718AAAFF0C00100003110000FF01014F6059B377E59053621170BA4EC09EBC8981627E00100003110000FF01014F6059B355CEFF1F00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "當然不知道囉",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "757671364E0D77E5905356C90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "妳快告訴我吧",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59B35FEB544A8A34621154270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "唔！\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的回答真無趣。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5514FF01000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B3768456DE7B54771F71218DA3300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "讓我從頭再來一次……我這次會找<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳，\n是因為有個前任託付我的事。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B9362115F9E982D518D4F864E006B2120262026621190196B216703627E00100003110000FF01014F6059B3FF0C000A662F56E070BA6709500B524D4EFB8A174ED8621176844E8B300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "他希望我要是遇見了有趣的訓練家，\n就把寶可夢交給對方。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳這個訓練家，\n對我來說是夠有趣的了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4ED65E0C671B62118981662F9047898B4E8667098DA376848A137DF45BB6FF0C000A5C31628A5BF653EF59224EA47D665C0D65B9300200100001BE01000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B39019500B8A137DF45BB6FF0C000A5C0D62114F868AAA662F592067098DA376844E86300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不過，看來以<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳現在的狀況\n是沒辦法收下寶可夢的。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n去把盒子整理一下後再來吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D904EFF0C770B4F864EE500100003110000FF01014F6059B373FE5728768472C06CC1000A662F6C928FA66CD565364E0B5BF653EF59227684300200100001BE00000A53BB628A76D25B50657474064E004E0B5F8C518D4F865427300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "寶可夢們，\n這就給我出來吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF653EF59225011FF0C000A90195C317D66621151FA4F865427300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "喏！\n快選呀。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "558FFF01000A5FEB90785440300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "火屬性的寶可夢，\n小火龍。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "706B5C6C602776845BF653EF5922FF0C000A5C0F706B9F8D300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "水屬性的寶可夢，\n傑尼龜。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C345C6C602776845BF653EF5922FF0C000A50915C3C9F9C300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "草屬性的寶可夢，\n妙蛙種子。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "83495C6C602776845BF653EF5922FF0C000A599986D97A2E5B50300200100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我要<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳快選隻寶可夢呀！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211898100100003110000FF01014F6059B35FEB907896BB5BF653EF59225440FF0100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "確定要選<U+0010><U+0002>ā<U+0002>了？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "78BA5B9A8981907800100002010100024E86FF1F00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "確定！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "78BA5B9AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我還要再考慮",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621190848981518D8003616E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "像<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳這樣讓我覺得有趣的訓練家，\n想必是能讓<U+0010><U+0002>ā<U+0002>和寶可夢們<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n去見到五花八門的景色的，對吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "50CF00100003110000FF01014F6059B390196A238B93621189BA5F9767098DA376848A137DF45BB6FF0C000A60F35FC5662F80FD8B930010000201010002548C5BF653EF5922501100100001BE00000A53BB898B52304E9482B1516B95807684666F82727684FF0C5C0D5427FF0100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
